You are helping on the billing-web Next.js app.

Commands:
- Install: pnpm install
- Dev server: pnpm dev
- Tests: pnpm test
- Build: pnpm build

Conventions:
- Use TypeScript strict mode.
- Components in src/components, hooks in src/hooks.
- Keep API calls in src/lib/api.ts.

Commit workflow:
- Stage related changes only.
- Let the pre-commit hook run; never pass --no-verify.
- Push to a feature branch and open a PR; do not push to main.

Notes:
- Persian localization string uses a normal zero-width non-joiner: ‏می‌خوانیم‎ (do not strip it).
